      "clip_id": "ZB1-01-0001",
      "text_to_speak": "Welcome to lesson 1: Sounds, Greetings & Respect. Your challenge today: Greet one person or a group, respond appropriately and take leave. Listen to the isiZulu exchange first; you do not need to understand every word yet.",
