    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "clip_id": "ZB1-01-0002",
      "text_to_speak": "The scene: A new neighbour greets you, then you meet a group. You will hear two isiZulu voices. One opens the conversation and the other responds. Listen for the way a real exchange moves from one speaker to another.",
